<.shell current={:spinner}>
  <h1>Spinner</h1>
  <p class="lead">Says what slow thing is happening.</p>

  <div class="demo">
    <p class="paragraph">
      <.spinner>Refreshing…</.spinner>
    </p>
    <p class="hint">
      <.spinner>Calculating driving distances for 14 members…</.spinner>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>When to use</h2>
  <p>Work that takes more than a second, such as a refresh or a call to Mapbox.</p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Name the slow thing, with an ellipsis.</li>
    <li>
      In a button, it replaces the button's text. See the busy state on <a href={
        page_path(:button)
      }>Button</a>.
    </li>
    <li>Spinners slow down when the system asks for reduced motion.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>In the app</h2>
  <p><code>&lt;.spinner&gt;Refreshing…&lt;/.spinner&gt;</code>.</p>
</.shell>
